# Only the image build files are needed in the Docker build context (source code is mounted
# read-only at run time, and .env must never enter an image).
*
!orchestration/docker/
!backend/docker/
# The web application source, built inside the backend image (installed modules and old builds
# are excluded: the image runs `npm ci` and `npm run build` itself).
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
